    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 9th level, a reaper learns to sustain themselves with the minimum possible in order to hunt their prey relentlessly. The reaper only needs an eighth of their usual required food and water to survive, and the reaper only needs to sleep 2 hours per day to gain the benefit of 8 hours of sleep.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/reaper#toc84\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
